@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_1
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(1)
PRINTFORML This purifying sensation seemed to appear out of nowhere one night, and immediately catapulted up the ranks.
PRINTFORML Her past is a complete mystery besides being mentored by the Border of Phantasm. Even old Makai couldn't stop her swift rise to the top. 
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Obviously a woman born to kill, this prodigy is able to predict the actions of the fighters around her.
PRINTFORML She generally dodges extremely well, constantly flying around everywhere.
PRINTFORML Her purification rod has the accuracy and control to handle its massive projectile count.
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_10001
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(1)
PRINTFORML A shrine maiden who suddenly appeared in Gensokyo one night since her age was still on the clock, and quickly rose to the top.
PRINTFORML Defeated, but not given up, the shrine maiden has undergone vigorous training to beat the rising competition.
PRINTFORML The overwhelming amount of bullets produced by her uncompromising magic tuned rod and her godlike Danmaku skills are unparalleled.
PRINTFORML Her very excellence has become a new legend of the World of Fantasy.
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_8
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(8)
PRINTFORML A fifteen-year old researcher who works for the professor on board the Probability Space Hypervessel.
PRINTFORML Since education is vastly accelerated in her world, she received her graduate degree in comparative physics at age thirteen,
PRINTFORML and has been working with Yumemi ever since, choosing to follow her into Gensokyo.
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML Wielding a unique AG-13 assault rifle that takes railgun sabots, her aim is deadly and she boasts the ability to stop time as well.
PRINTFORML While still very young, the Seihou-spec bionics on her gives her technique equivalent to a seasoned Gensokyan veteran.
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_26
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(26)
PRINTFORML One of the Sages of Gensokyo, maintainers of the Gensokyan status quo.
PRINTFORML She has the regal bearing of a queen - and acts like one, too. Not too many people like her.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Her fighting style is gorgeous, truly fit for a queen. Even when her Danmaku looks pretty rough, it's all part of her plan.
PRINTFORML She also packs the ability to summon a moving train, super hard to dodge and can end your day easily.
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_38
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(38)
PRINTFORML The Dominator of Former Hell, Koishi has trained her gut instinct to not fail her at any moment.
PRINTFORML Sister to the Satori Maiden, she has however closed her eye as it kept overwhelming her during battles.
PRINTFORML Despite just fighting on vibes alone, any battle she faces is pretty much a pushover for her.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Her unconscious third-eye was converted into an extremely effective weapon.
PRINTFORML It shoots three types of supercharged danmaku, each with their own adverse effects if hit.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_43
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(43)
PRINTFORML A legendary fighter, she's one of The Sages of Gensokyo.
PRINTFORML A long time ago she had to cut off her arm to prevent a spirit from taking over and still feels guilty about it.
PRINTFORML Temporarily retired from Danmaku.world, her current skills aren't what they once were, but she still shoots razor sharp.
PRINTFORML Displays a veteran's dignity when using Danmaku.
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_45
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(45)
PRINTFORML A magic-user from Gensokyo typically holed up in her laboratory.
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML Despite being an accomplished magician, she cares little for magic, and instead pursues scientific discovery instead.
PRINTFORML With a regular machine pistol as her main combat tool, the magic takes second place for other things such as healing and buffing.
PRINTFORML Her extremist mindset make her an outlier within Gensokyo, and she's considered a heretic by many.
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_46
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(46)
PRINTFORML A samurai wandering Gensokyo.
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML Determined to obtain the power of the Hakurei for herself, she eagerly trains herself to gain the strength to overcome the shrine maiden.
PRINTFORML While generally presenting herself as confident and driven, she feels somewhat insecure about her femininity
PRINTFORML , and occasionally worries about being mistaken for a man.
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_47
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(47)
PRINTFORML A tank engineer with a workshop hidden in a remote area of Gensokyo.
PRINTFORML For unknown reasons, she once attacked the Hakurei Shrine with her tanks and an army of ghosts she created,
PRINTFORML but she has kept quiet until the the opening of Danmaku.world.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Relying entirely on her machines, her own fighting abilities are rather lacking.
PRINTFORML Her Falkenberg rocket launcher reminds her of her tank's guns and only wants combatants wielding the same machine.
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_48
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(48)
PRINTFORML An inhabitant of Makai.
PRINTFORML She enjoys visiting new places and meeting new people, and can occasionally be seen in Gensokyo fighting rivals.
PRINTFORML However, she doesn't have much of a presence of her own, and people hardly take notice of her.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Even with just the standard-issue Makai training and BENCHY pistol, she's no slouch and beat Stage 6 without breaking a sweat.
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_80
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(80)
PRINTFORML Despite her still somewhat childlike appearance, the ninth generation Hieda servant uses just her fists and quietly roams the Human Village alone.
PRINTFORML Whether due to extreme shyness or some other reason, she speaks very little and exudes a mysterious aura.
PRINTFORML Although it seemed to be her first battle, she remained composed throughout, showing glimpses of strong determination and fighting talent.
PRINTFORML She frequents the Village, so another encounter with her may be possible.
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_10080
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(80)
PRINTFORML The mysterious girl one encountered in the Human Village has since acquired an anachronistic AImthropic handgun, as well as the ability to use Danmaku.
PRINTFORML With her new machine and ability, she has challenged many rivals, gaining a reputation among the new generation of fighters.
PRINTFORML Her technique adheres to the basics, but her accuracy, dodging, and use of Youjutsu have visibly improved, demonstrating typical gunslinger movements.
PRINTFORML She has also been spotted receiving training from a "long-lost Hieda servant" at the square, which may explain her rapid progress in such a short time.
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_20080
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(80)
PRINTFORML That mysterious girl one encountered on the Human Village that day has since drawn admirers with her shining existence, growing to create a wave of the era.
PRINTFORML Her newly acquired handgun, the Citation Needed, with its enhanced capacitors, electromagnetic gauss propulsion, and uncompromising AI tuning, boasts immense power.
PRINTFORML The receiver and grip supporting it is also meticulous, reflecting her countless trials and errors.
PRINTFORML She calmly targets the opponent and fires with her sharp, unerring reflexes. 
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_60080
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(80)
PRINTFORML The Ninth Generation Hieda servant only went out to fight to "find a heir", to have her bloodline not end with her.
PRINTFORML Initially fighting alone with no one to share her feelings, her first race profoundly shook her.
PRINTFORML The experience awakened a desire "to meet more people," leading her to connect with many fighters through battles.
PRINTFORML Now, having finally resolved her rivalry with all her might with her first worthy opponent whom she had been pursuing, she has reached a turning point. 
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_97
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(97)
PRINTFORML This highly skilled Amanojaku has had a long career, but she's disliked by other fighters because of her devious nature.
PRINTFORML Her heat is just a .44 Magnum, but it has plenty of power and is easy to handle.
PRINTFORML Because of her power to reverse things, the barrel is turned pointed her, meaning that a normal user would just shoot themselves.
RETURN

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_99
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(99)
PRINTFORML She's a Lunarian princess, but she's known for being the best-dressed fighter on the Moon.
PRINTFORML Her infatuation with style and appearance is just as strong in battle, and she detests those that aren't dressed up for a fight.
PRINTFORML As the sister to Yorihime, the duo rule the Lunar Capital with iron fists, keeping as much external influence out.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Her Enabler consists of an eastern-style manual fan, enhancing her Danmaku ability compared to native casting.
PRINTFORML She can cast more Danmaku, with higher potency and at a higher rate of fire. This however costs quite a bit of MP to sustain.
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_102
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(102)
PRINTFORML There are many rumors of it, such as "the demon haunting the World of Fantasy" or "the ghost of a God from decades ago."
PRINTFORML Whatever it is, she won't appear unless her opponent has truly mastered the art of the fight,
PRINTFORML ・・・and will only speak to combatants she feels are able to comprehend her level of ability.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Underneath her caring exterior is a divine powerhouse with all types of Youjutsu mastered. The ability to create items, abilities, even people out of nothing is truly baffling.
PRINTFORML With seemingly magical offensive ability and extraordinary maneuverability, she truly deserves the title of legend.
PRINTFORML Some speculate she's the last gasp of the Old Era.
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_103
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(103)
PRINTFORML Created by a divine being to test various bionic enhancements on, this maid serves as the Pandemonium's cleanup crew that keeps the place tidy.
PRINTFORML Her cybernetics, combined with her innate Youjutsu abilities giving her advanced combat technique as well as TSP eventually earned her the title of "The Perfect Maid".
PRINTFORML Recently, encountering with the new generation of fighters dominating the World of Fantasy ignited a strong passion in her to get out there and show to the world what she's made of.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML As The Dominator of Makai, she's rarely challenged, and any challengers that try her are decimated in seconds.
PRINTFORML Sometimes even shorter- thanks to innate time stop.
PRINTFORML Her beloved SLICER boasts unparalleled perfection and exudes an overwhelming aura.
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_106
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(106)
PRINTFORML A Japanese high-school student with a Gensokyan-taught wildness that is captivating.
PRINTFORML Her straightforward personality unintentionally garnered her an all-girls fan club.
PRINTFORML Her flawless shooting and perfected machine apply intense pressure on her battle opponents.
PRINTFORML For years, she has been pained by the cycles of vengeance and grudges among the Gensokyo fighters.
PRINTFORML She sees battling as a form of communication and believes that if they duel side by side, they will eventually be able to speak the same "language."
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_114
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(114)
PRINTFORML A vampire girl who was once a gatekeeper at the lake in the mountains behind the Hakurei Shrine.
PRINTFORML However, it's not entirely clear whether she is truly a vampire, or just a youkai who sucks blood.
PRINTFORML 
PRINTFORML Currently, she lives with the owner of Mugenkan, who moved the entire building to the Garden of the Sun.
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_115
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(115)
PRINTFORML A girl wielding a signature scythe who used to serve as a gatekeeper at Mugenkan.
PRINTFORML Due to Kurumi's excellence at her job, she hadn't had much opportunity of having an actual fight, so her skills seemed to have dulled.
PRINTFORML 
PRINTFORML Perhaps now in Danmaku.world, she can hone her melee skills against other rivals...
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_116
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(116)
PRINTFORML With her older sister, Gengetsu, she is the owner of the (Unnamed) Dream World. Together they are one person.
PRINTFORML She's dressed as a maid, but she's hardly a servant.
PRINTFORML 
PRINTFORML She has a lot of experience in dating, but it seems that she never went beyond the line yet in her relationships.
PRINTFORML She is steadfast and has great composure and confidence.
PRINTFORML This makes her have good traits for a fighter, but her technique is rather lacking compared to her sister.
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_145
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(145)
PRINTFORML A supposed Gensokyo police officer and a self-proclaimed princess.
PRINTFORML Legend has it that she abducted and imprisoned the red-white Shrine Maiden herself, which may or may not be true.
PRINTFORML A known recluse and a collector of things. She's got a few screws loose, enough so that even other weirdos tend to stay away from her.
PRINTFORML Although she lived in the village, no one had seen her for ages until one day she decided to wake up and get back to work again.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML There's a strange aura and power emanating from her, even though she appears to be human.
PRINTFORML She bears a .500 Magnum revolver, the most powerful pistol cartridge of the Midworld, fit for an officer like her.
PRINTFORML Even though the power the revolver has is immense, her aim is left to be desired.
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_146
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(146)
PRINTFORML A devil of some kind with large purple wings and a wand who arrived from Makai. Said to be able to turn into a bat.
PRINTFORML She has a cocky attitude, but is keen on fighting, given the skills and experience she possesses.
PRINTFORML Has no affiliation with vampires, but seems somehow connected to Sariel, whom she greatly admires...
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Declares herself a devil of the night, with advanced Makai training.
PRINTFORML Her skill is the pinnacle of most mortals, but has a limited amount of Youjutsu that she uses.
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_147
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(147)
PRINTFORML A figure said to be an angel of death who arrived from Makai.
PRINTFORML She's quite ancient and seems to be well-versed in many ways in addition to her being quite approachable.
PRINTFORML However, her physical presence is rather faint, resulting in her being much more delicate than the rest.
RETURN 1

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_148
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(148)
PRINTFORML A guardian of the gateway into Makai.
PRINTFORML She's good friends not only with her fellow Makai residents (past and present),
PRINTFORML but also with SDM's gatekeeper, perhaps because they share (or used to share) the same line of work.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML She's relatively weak for a Makai, despite her maxed out combat skill.
PRINTFORML With her BENCHY however, it practically makes Makai impossible to enter except for top level Stage 6 fighters
RETURN 1

;Musket Guy
;Musket Guy No. 1
@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3000
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3000))
PRINTFORML When his older brother left the team and dueling entirely four years ago, he was forced to become the leader of Musket Guy.
PRINTFORML He's evolved to become much more aggressive than his older brother, constantly pushing for the advantage.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Originally a tool for hunting local big game, his musket has been tuned for combat use.
PRINTFORML Ironically, despite looking like a tanegashima, he has converted it into a percussion-cap breech action that fires paper ball and powder cartridges.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3001
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3001))
PRINTFORML A kind dude that likes the new leader of Musket Guy and tries to follow his steps.
PRINTFORML Turns out that he's supporting a leader who tends to collapse from pressure.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He likes to aim with his hip because it's comfortable, but doesn't realize the degree of inaccuracy compared to aiming properly.
PRINTFORML He also uses a matchlock system for his musket, while the rest of them are using either flintlocks or percussion-caps, making his shots predictable.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3002
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3002))
PRINTFORML Having been recruited by the former Musket Guy leader, he got himself a job in YMKA just so he could be testing weapons at work.
PRINTFORML He's got quite the masculine personality, making him quite polarizing. Males are quite attracted to him but most ladys find his personality a turn off.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He wields a light weight caplock with an ergonomic stock and can reload it even faster than any other muzzle-loading musket.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3003
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3003))
PRINTFORML An a rabid reader particular about the ideal combat style for his dream weapon: A laser rifle.
PRINTFORML His theories are almost perfect. His techniques on simulations are great too, so what's the problem?
PRINTFORML Money!
PRINTFORML He has no money for anything beyond a musket, so his theory and techniques are useless.
PRINTFORML He's trying to save up, but it's not going anywhere.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3004
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3004))
PRINTFORML He joined the team simultaneously with Takayanagi, but in complete contrast to him, he operates his musket relying on feeling.
PRINTFORML He has masterful control and reload technique, but lacks concentration during fights, so he misses quite often.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Hopping from job to job, he never has enough cash to spend upgrading his gun significantly.
PRINTFORML His basic strategy consists of trying to push out as many rounds as his musket can, but is generally overwhelmed by most Danmaku users.

;Little Gang
@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3005
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3005))
PRINTFORML He's quite skilled but doesn't frequently take part in battles, so stays rather stagnant in skill level.
PRINTFORML Well-liked by his teammates for his happy and helpful personality.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML His revolver is not heavily tuned, but shoots better than Windurgers because it utilizes 120\% of its potential.
PRINTFORML Likes aiming slowly and counts shots to make sure his shots hit.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3006
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3006))
PRINTFORML He worked hard as a farmer to get a revolver and into the scene, even if it's just an muzzleloader and not a Windurger.
PRINTFORML Too poor to modify his pistol, but tries to compensate with skill.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He's trying to cover his weapons's outdated design with his rather fast shooting technique.
PRINTFORML Sprays and prays at the target's general direction, hoping one of his 5 shots from his double-action converted revolver actually lands.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3007
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3007))
PRINTFORML An out-of-work Japanese comedian planning a TV show called "Dodging Magic Bullets for ￥1,000,000."
PRINTFORML Researching parts of his show by temporally setting up shop in Gensoyko and fighting with this banner.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He dives in and out of cover quite a bit but doesn't go in and out cleanly, damaging his weapon by hitting walls frequently.
PRINTFORML Because of this, he has to take his weapon apart often to replace damaged parts.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3008
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3008))
PRINTFORML A failure on the skies until Happy and Run found him and showed him the ropes.
PRINTFORML Admires his team leader quite fondly and tries to steal his techniques.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He tries to take careful shots like the leader does, but he's not quite at the leader's level.
PRINTFORML His weapon is rather old and rusty and doesn't shoot as well than when he first got it.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3009
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3009))
PRINTFORML Used to shoot at targets on his backyard and in ranges, but one day suddenly lost interest.
PRINTFORML He Happy and Run about a year later and discovered dueling, thoroughly enjoying the risk.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML While having better technique than the team leader, he sometimes loses his focus during a battle and panics.
PRINTFORML During this state, he blind-fires which allows him to shoot without exposing himself, albeit all over the place.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3010
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3010))
PRINTFORML Lazy dude who hates combat training and doing maintenance on his repeating musket but claims to love dueling.
PRINTFORML Even the kind-hearted leader Takasu is fed up with him.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He can take out targets well, but that's because he aims slow, even slower than the leader.
PRINTFORML He fights at his own pace and really loves to stay in cover.

;FAEE
@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3011
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3011))
PRINTFORML She is one of the stronger fairies of Gensokyo, although not in the level of The Big Fairy or Number 9, Idiot.
PRINTFORML She trained her innate Danmaku Youjutsu to help stay protected from bad actors such as hostile youkai.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Optimizing her Danmaku tech to an extreme, it's powerful to the point she can defeat quite a few Stage 3 opponents.
PRINTFORML She chooses to stay in Stage 1 due to much of the other members being there.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3012
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3012))
PRINTFORML Since being created by the fairy spirit, she has had a long-standing relationship with the leader, Monkey Flight Sasuke.
PRINTFORML They both compete against each other so they could hone their skills in.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML She's increased her MP but otherwise does not work on her Youjutsu abilities other than Danmaku much.
PRINTFORML With high situational awareness, she has an all-encompassing skill of calmly handling battles.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3013
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3013))
PRINTFORML A Kadashi Spirit editor who flies around the village with pure reckless abandon. Her being a fairy contradicts the norm that fairies are dumb.
PRINTFORML Quite knowledgeable about side streets and can thread through any crowded road with ease.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Unable to accept Danmaku's lack of stopping power compared to conventional weaponry, but makes up for it with superior fighting tech.
PRINTFORML Her advantage of slipping by weak spots while her opponent is blind is no surprise.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3014
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3014))
PRINTFORML She's been friends with the leader, Monkey Flight Sasuke, and 373 since creation.
PRINTFORML Later on, she was enticed by the leader to step into the world of battles.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML A defect during creation caused him to not have innate Danmaku ability.
PRINTFORML Previously used a shooter cast inherited from a retired fighter, but has finally attained his wish of learning Danmaku Youjutsu.
PRINTFORML She just switched so he is not yet fully attuned, but his high technique covers that fact.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3015
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3015))
PRINTFORML Called upon by the leader at the Misty Lake looking for another competent fighter, and after impressing the leader, she joined the team.
PRINTFORML Her sister-in-law, a combat trainer, had polished up her technique at her request beforehand, but this fairy doesn't believe that she was used as an experiment.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Her technique was beautifully tuned so that there was nothing to complain about, but this has in fact forced her to completely relearn her Youjutsu.
PRINTFORML She has been able to attain some sense of competent Danamku with it though.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3016
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3016))
PRINTFORML She is a veteran who became proficient at Danmaku after practicing by playing a lot of Touhou.
PRINTFORML Her biggest achievement is beating all of the FREAX OS Touhou games on Lunatic with no bombs and no hits taken, hench the LNN title.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML She believes foremost that Danmaku is logic-driven and thus is at odds with 373 who believes in instinct more.
PRINTFORML Lacking any consideration for innocents, she's constantly dashing in the sky and firing indiscriminately.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3017
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3017))
PRINTFORML Attracted to Monkey Flight Sasuke's intellect and romantic nature, she has maintained a relationship with her.
PRINTFORML Now it looks like they are discussing a lesbian cross-fairy marriage.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Recently her fighting has suddenly become rather proficient for a fairy.
PRINTFORML With her technique getting out 120\% of her body's potential, she exhibits overwhelming agility comparable to Stage 4 human fighters.
PRINTFORML Her offensive ability is still however the same level as a standard Stage 1 combatant.

;Shooting Funs
@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3018
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3018))
PRINTFORML A manager for a department store from the Seihou World.
PRINTFORML Because of his good looks he's popular with women and gets lots of gifts on his birthday.
PRINTFORML His flintlock was actually a present from a Seihou company president's wife who called it a "cool relic".
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Like his character, his dueling technique is also cool:
PRINTFORML He never attacks frantically, he doesn't excessively customize his weapon, he just does the basics:
PRINTFORML Cheap ammunition, factory parts, and lots, and lots of training.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3019
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3019))
PRINTFORML A combatant who knows deep down what it means to bet your life on a battle.
PRINTFORML He wears a flashy and quite sharp blazer, and sometimes he's also seen with a beautiful woman.
PRINTFORML No one knows his age, but it is suspected he's quite young.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML His optimizations are subtle but he hits the main points.
PRINTFORML He is better at recovering from a disadvantage than staying in advantage.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3020
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3020))
PRINTFORML While he looks like a typical Outside World citizen, he was actually quite famous during one part of Nagoya's dueling scene.
PRINTFORML Now however he's reclused himself to Gensokyo to help get away from the noise and to try out a different dueling scene.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He switched weapons recently and he seems unable to get the feel for his new piece.
PRINTFORML He's not good on long battles, so it is hard for him to keep up when they grow long.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3021
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3021))
PRINTFORML A hopeless romantic looking for a lucky break somewhere, working as a stocker.
PRINTFORML Joining the team as an attempt to get to the leader's good side, she still hasn't gotten any kind of love.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML She's tested quite a few weapons from the team, but they all seem to feel the same to her.
PRINTFORML Her revolver is quite stock and still has the standard manual rotation 5-shot cylinder.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3022
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3022))
PRINTFORML Junior to Shirogane, the leader of the team. He was hooked onto dueling after watching the leader fight another rival.
PRINTFORML While a little sensitive, he has the makings of a good combatant.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Achieving decent marksmanship without anyone teaching him how, he can land 5/5 shots on moving targets 20m away.
PRINTFORML However, his reloading technique is unrefined and needs more work, exasperated by his choice of using a muzzleloader.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3023
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3023))
PRINTFORML He formerly played soccer with his local team in Nagoya.
PRINTFORML Very inexperiened, as he's just gotten into the dueling scene.
PRINTFORML He graduated from  from the same high school as the team leader Shirogane.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He modified his gun into an easy to use double-action revolver.
PRINTFORML Strengthening the barrels and trigger to allow for the capability, he can push out five shots in a couple of seconds if he needs to.
PRINTFORML His reaction time is excellent and can fire his gun from a holstered position quite quickly.

;Real Echo
@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3024
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3024))
PRINTFORML Head of an genetics club in a private Outside World university.
PRINTFORML He often looks like he is deep in thought, when all he's doing is daydreaming.
PRINTFORML His knowledge of genetic modification is at a professional level, and sometimes even gets contracts for his work.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He uses no weapon, not even a single form of magic.
PRINTFORML He modified his body to have wolf ears, tail, and claws, so that makes his claws his natural weapon.
PRINTFORML Despite his vast combat knowledge, his style is also relatively simple, since it just works for him.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3025
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3025))
PRINTFORML American born and bred wolf girl, her parents are Japanese but she lived in America through high school.
PRINTFORML Because of her tail, it's difficult for her to find clothes and sometimes has to cut holes through pants and skirts with her claws.
PRINTFORML She challenged and lost a battle with the leader, and that led her to join the team since she wanted to be on his side.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Her claws cut beautifully thanks to constant trimmings.
PRINTFORML It is a high-performance weapon with an overall high level finish, especially for one that's natural.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3026
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3026))
PRINTFORML When he is defeated, he sheds dog-like whimpers of regret
PRINTFORML But when anyone calls out his act, he protests with 「I'm not crying」.
PRINTFORML He doesn't even remember how many years he's had to repeat in school.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML If only his dislike of losing and reckless nature were used for good, he would otherwise be able to overwhelm his opponent.
PRINTFORML His technique with his wolf claws is easy-to-handle and quite effective.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3027
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3027))
PRINTFORML Even though he was a wolf guy from birth, he still makes continuous mistakes that even a beginner wouldn't make.
PRINTFORML Despite this, his technique is certainly quite up to snuff thanks to his experience.
PRINTFORML He knows everything there is to know about the merits and shortcomings of his natural weapon, but just has the most trouble applying said knowledge.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3028
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3028))
PRINTFORML A cheerful wolf boy, he is always either dancing or singing, and if not that, dueling.
PRINTFORML He appreciates art, and has vast knowledge about Hispanic culture. His dream is to move to Peru.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He is the type who trains his genetically enhanced body intensely.
PRINTFORML He has trained himself to endure long battles. With further fine tuning, he'll be able to be more agile and excel in short ones too.


;Genesis R
@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3029
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3029))
PRINTFORML He's got quite a long tenure as a duelist, having been in the scene since graduating high school.
PRINTFORML Both a rival and a friend to SEEKS, he sometimes join forces to fight mutual enemies.
PRINTFORML Dueling for him is a one-shot deal. He won't risk anything unless there's a clear shot of him winning.
PRINTFORML He is truly one with his katana, and his blade responds to any slight handling of the hilt.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3030
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3030))
PRINTFORML A skilled attorney for Nagoya's court who deals primarily with big business cases.
PRINTFORML Known for driving to the courthouse in a quite-bombastic customized car.
PRINTFORML He uses quite a bit of foul language in his legal arguments, which makes people think he's quite rash.
PRINTFORML On vacation to Gensokyo to try out fighting physically instead of with words.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He picked a shovel as his main weapon since it was cheap and has a large strike area.
PRINTFORML Using it to his advantage, he aims for the head and tries to bonk his opponents unconscious.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3031
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3031))
PRINTFORML Underground surgeon that charges exorbitant prices for his operations.
PRINTFORML He's always calm and keeps his expression cool even during a heated battle.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML No one else in his team is able to match his boldness.
PRINTFORML He fights like everyone's a target, even he has a blind eye towards allies and himself.
PRINTFORML Despite the reckless abandon, he has never harmed an ally or civilian during his battles.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3032
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3032))
PRINTFORML A math professor at a local Nagoya college, he's has gained a bad reputation with his students due to him being strict with credits in his courses.
PRINTFORML Feared by his colleagues for driving to academic events in a customized vehicle, since he always seems to make them jealous.
PRINTFORML On a temporary administrative leave after failing a majority of his students last semester, he took to Gensokyo to avoid the backlash.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He picked himself a knife as it fit his teaching style, short and brief.
PRINTFORML His attacks are precise, however he's just an average fighter otherwise.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3033
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3033))
PRINTFORML Secretary for a major Japanese congressman, his boss tells him to get votes from Gensokyo.
PRINTFORML However, he's the type that separates his work and pleasure, and just ignores his instructions.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He's been using a wooden spear as his main weapon, even though he can easily afford one made out of Uranium.
PRINTFORML His main reasoning is that he likes to use weapons until they break.

;@-ttention
@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3034
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3034))
PRINTFORML Working as a DJ in one of the hottest parts of Nagoya, he was hooked onto hip-hop while he was still in elementary school.
PRINTFORML His main inspiration for getting into dueling was an American rapper that got himself into a lot of fights to "settle scores" for his gang
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He doesn't hide his aggressive side from fighters that push him to the edge, and challenges others with a competitive spirit.
PRINTFORML When he isn't fighting, he's inconspicuous and acts just like a typical village, aside from the outfit.


@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3035
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3035))
PRINTFORML A rapper that highly respects his leader, being the most friendly member of the team.
PRINTFORML He is often approached by other teams for deals due to his calm, non-aggressive demeanor.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML While his handgun looks like a typical Tricorne CCW15, it is vastly customized when it comes to the internals.
PRINTFORML Such improvements include a match barrel, a hair trigger, glow sights, and a more reliable ejector.
PRINTFORML Anyone he challenges that doesn't know the changes he's done is going to end on his favor.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3036
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3036))
PRINTFORML A brilliant dancer winning many dance contest awards.
PRINTFORML He started dueling to improve his dancing techniques, since dodging bullets and blades uses most of the same motions.
PRINTFORML 
PRINTFORML The clothes he wears are light: A simple t-shirt, light shorts, panties, and sneakers
PRINTFORML Such wear allows him to weave through crowds, quickly react to changes in the battle, and overall move around quickly

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3037
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3037))
PRINTFORML A rapper with respect to his fellow team members.
PRINTFORML He already has multiple CDs released making quite decent charts
PRINTFORML During fights, he lets his gun and his movements speak for him.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Being a rapper from the Outside World, he isn't fully used to how a full-on handgun handles.
PRINTFORML Even then, he has quite okay technique and doesn't make mistakes that most rookies do.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3038
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3038))
PRINTFORML The only female member of @-tention.
PRINTFORML Her dancer reflexes manifest in her combat techniques, especially her movement.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Her main advantage in combat comes with those reflexes.
PRINTFORML Her pistol is stock and uses reserve ammunition, she doesn't train accuracy or reloading, and she isn't very tough either.


@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3039
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3039))
PRINTFORML A DJ just starting out, having been given an invitation by the team leader.
PRINTFORML He loves guns and customized most of the team's weapons 
PRINTFORML However he sits at the lower ranks due to his lack of courage 
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He takes battles slow, moves slow, and is overall not very confident in his technique
PRINTFORML He gets himself hurt quite a lot due to it.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3040
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3040))
PRINTFORML Friends with two of his team members since they were in the same dance school as him.
PRINTFORML He's a Japanese American, born in America from a Japanese family.
PRINTFORML Moved to Gensokyo with the rest of the team members, fighting in search of his identity.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML The barrel of his pistol is shorter than the guns of his teammates, making the weapon lighter and have a smaller profile.
PRINTFORML While it's better for concealment, this affects him when he's challenged and actually has to use the pistol.

;Seeks
@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3041
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3041))
PRINTFORML A leader with high ambitions, not hesitating to say rough things or command his team members like pawns.
PRINTFORML He joins forces with the leader of GENESIS R if necessary.
PRINTFORML He fights with grit, but his technique comes across well.
PRINTFORML His title in Japanese, 「神鬼」 reads "Shinki", despite this, he has no relation to another fighter with the same name.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML His rifle has an emphasis on accuracy, and at the same time, ergonomics too.
PRINTFORML The weapon's single shot capacity is its only shortcoming. During this time he's focused on getting another bullet down range.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3042
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3042))
PRINTFORML Combatant who recognizes his leader as his sole rival.
PRINTFORML A contest between him and the team leader lead to the team being made after hearing rumors of the leader being in the area.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Despite dueling for a while, he can't get the same sensation as when he started dueling.
PRINTFORML His rifle feeds with LAC17 stripper clips, meaning he can fire five shots before having to get a new stripper clip.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3043
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3043))
PRINTFORML To master his violin skills, he went to Vienna to be taught by one of the masters of the violin.
PRINTFORML While there, he also partook in the underground fighting scene and bought himself a rifle from a weapons smuggler.
PRINTFORML He practices self control before a fight or concert and it keeps him very composed.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Having no fear of speed, he zips around the battle arena trying to outmaneuver his opponent.
PRINTFORML While sometimes getting himself into risky situations, he doesn't find himself in a disadvantage often.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3044
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3044))
PRINTFORML While usually a calm middle-aged Japanese dance instructor, once he gets himself a weapon, it's like it possesses him.
PRINTFORML He grows an intense attitude and acts like the weapon is an extension of his arm.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He takes too many risks when fighting, trying to secure "one-shot" moves
PRINTFORML While it's impressive when they do land, it most often leads him knocked out and losing the battle.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3045
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3045))
PRINTFORML Although he criticizes major artists for "selling out", he hoping to get contracts with major record companies.
PRINTFORML He possess the skill to instantly discern the condition of any firearm by the sound the action makes due to his sense of hearing.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He has not excessively customized his weapon, leaving his gun's potential on the table.
PRINTFORML His marksmanship is just slightly better than an amateur and he needs much more training.

;NIPPON-BASHI
@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3046
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3046))
PRINTFORML Manager of a software company that develops business management apps.
PRINTFORML He wants everything in his life to be done efficiently, like an assembly line.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML When there's a lapse on his opponent's judgement, he goes for it and tries to use his taser.
PRINTFORML While the taser will make any combatant yield in short ranges, it can't hit anything past 15 meters.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3047
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3047))
PRINTFORML Lead programmer of the team leader's software company, brought into the scene by the leader as well.
PRINTFORML Now trusted both at his workplace and in the battlefield for being great support for the team.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Priding himself on tough, but steadily demanding fights, he doesn't give up if pushed into a disadvantage.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3048
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3048))
PRINTFORML On one side, she's a serious, quiet, and loyal secretary that keeps to herself.
PRINTFORML On her other side, she's a mechanical maniac with knowledge on a vast variety of machines of many types.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML She hasn't been battling for a while due to being exhausted with rasing her children.
PRINTFORML While her battle style allows her to land fatal blows in just a few shots, it's demanding on her mind and can make her lose out of mental fatigue.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3049
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3049))
PRINTFORML Young IT system adminstratior working for multiple companies as a contractor.
PRINTFORML Spends a ton of money on his computer which he uses for personal use as well as for "work things"
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He likes to take his battles close and personel, even though he mainly uses Danmaku to fight.
PRINTFORML This is mainly so that he can dominate them and shut off any use of magic or weapon and end the battle peacefully.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3050
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3050))
PRINTFORML A managemenent consultant with an addiction to spending money.
PRINTFORML He buys lots of software every month that he barely touches aside from to upload them onto the internet, and as a result is quite broke.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He has a digital audio player with music he edited himself and blasts his ears with it during battle.
PRINTFORML His combat style is rythmical and ecentric, but not very practical.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3051
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3051))
PRINTFORML Strong with numbers and saves stats for every battle he does.
PRINTFORML Shows up at the team leader's office twice a week and often gets into debates about battles.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He fights in the same outfit he works with so his wife doesn't find out about his antics.
PRINTFORML His outfit gets damaged often because of it, but he has a tailor that he goes to after every battle.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3052
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3052))
PRINTFORML One of the industry's top network adminstrators, setting up bussiness networks involving thousands of clients.
PRINTFORML Usually glued to his servers and keeping the network running, but during his days off he takes off to Gensokyo and participates in the dueling scene.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He has a watch that tracks much of his vitals such as heartbeat and blood flow. 
PRINTFORML Such functions now come in monitoring chips, but he still respects old non-intrusive methods more.

;FENCE Sitters
@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3053
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3053))
PRINTFORML He became captivated to the calming art of fencing since he started dueling 4 years ago.
PRINTFORML Entrusted as the leader of the team, he has lead the team to go for a melee-focused route when it came to battles.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He's quiet and gentle, and so are his moves when he fights.
PRINTFORML When pent up his stress however, he goes for big bold moves, trying to deal as many hits as possible.
PRINTFORML As battles grow longer, he gradually becomes calmer and his moves become more calculated and risk adverse.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3054
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3054))
PRINTFORML He met the leader 4 years ago through internet BBS.
PRINTFORML After talking about swordplay to him, they formed FENCE Sitters.
PRINTFORML He usually acts as the manager of the team when the leader becomes busy with other things.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He's the type of fighter that assesses his opponent so he doesn't make careless moves that get him hurt.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3055
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3055))
PRINTFORML Having lived a life of luxury, he has everything he need, but he always felt something was missing.
PRINTFORML Then he learned of a game where your life is the bet, and that's how he got hooked on dueling.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Although he has a very strong will, he doesn't possess much fighting skill that he's proud of.
PRINTFORML He usually out-preserves his opponent in long battles.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3056
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3056))
PRINTFORML One day when he was going to work, he was challenged by thug and managed throughly beat him down, experencing his first hit of the drug known as battling.
PRINTFORML He constantly looks up to the team leader, who uses the same weapon as him.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML His blade is lighter than what the leader uses. This makes it easier to swing, but the hits are weaker as a result. 
PRINTFORML The lighter blade also makes it easier for him to move and to dodge attacks too.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3057
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3057))
PRINTFORML He got into FENCE Sitters when duelists from the team came for blade repairs.
PRINTFORML Highly valued by the team as he can forge new swords and other sharp melee items cheaply.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML He tests a variety of swords with different hilts, blades, and guards.
PRINTFORML As each fighter prefers different parts for their weapons, he has came up with combos for the ideal weapon for each member.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3058
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3058))
PRINTFORML He drives trucks and vans, deliving valuable cargo across Japan.
PRINTFORML When he's done working, he goes to Gensokyo and battles fellow rivals with his sword. 
PRINTL
PRINTFORML For him, maneauvering his body around is kinda like driving a truck.
PRINTFORML He takes battles with ease, avoiding strafing as much as possible and only attacking when there's an open window.
PRINTFORML Because of his techniques, he's top two in the team, just below the team leader.

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3059
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3059))
PRINTFORML He's a chef for a restruant and really likes blades that cut clean without being too bulky.
PRINTFORML He likes to run a very light setup, with no armor and a dagger.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Dueling has made him much better when it came to cutting things, especially other combatants.
PRINTFORML He likes to run around his target and stab them in the back while they're still looking in the other direction.

;Rhythm Box
@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3060
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3060))

@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3219
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3219))
PRINTFORML In an alternative universe, a male Outsider of Gensokyo stormed the World of Fantasy and proceeded to become a Legend of his Gensokyo.
PRINTFORML A serial panty thief, a sexual deviant, and most importantly, a master of Spell Card regulated Danmaku.
PRINTFORML His sole ability: Stopping Time.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML His ability allowed him an advantage against most other Gensokyans, training, crafting, and stealing underwear right under their noses.
PRINTFORML In battles, he's constantly at a disadvantage due to the Danmaku Skills that others have, but his use of Danmaku Items helps offset this.
PRINTFORML The immaculate speech skill that he has also makes him an easy person to fall for. And if you resist, he can just put love drugs in your tea.
PRINTFORML He cheated against the Hourai one too-many times, and became an immortal Hourai person as a result, but his current existence has him as a phantom.
RETURN 1

;Niaobu-sama's Fan Club
@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_3422
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(LoG_GetRival(3422))
PRINTFORML Leader of the eponymous fetishist fan club, she was born with genetic nerve damage that made her and the entire Shime lineage incontinent both on the front and back.
PRINTFORML Because of her rather unfortunate last name and corresponding lack of potty training, she's taken the nickname of "Niaobu-sama".
PRINTFORML She's gained quite a bit of fans wanting to meet and battle her that she had to start a fighting team, which has advanced to the point of defeating some Stage 6 fighters.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML Famous for openly showing off her padding during battles, her technique revolves around flying and firing her railgun at a distance, since said padding makes it hard for her to move on the ground.
PRINTFORML Her railgun consists of a Cactus Company RAIL-IT, with the Gryzov PC-85 targeting computer on board. Don't get hit!


;FREAX
@LoG_RIVAL_INFO_339999
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER(43)
PRINTFORML Leader of the personified command team FREAX, she's a personification of the "rm" command.
PRINTFORML Her name comes from two options available, the -f option to force delete and -r for recursive deletion including folders.
PRINTFORML Both can be used to make -fr which coincidentally is the abbreviation for the French language.
PRINTFORML Unluckily to most users, the command doesn't remove the French language pack, but instead removes the specified folder ignoring permissions.

; A phantom existence said to have once rewritten every Legend of Gensokyo.
; Later called RECORD:K as a homage to the Romance of Three Kingdoms, some even doubt it ever existed.
; Rumor has it that it lead a million man army beyond the ability of any mortal and the charisma to handle it.
; Perhaps it reached that supreme realm only achievable by those who deeply love themselves for ages. 

; A phantom called "Makoto", frequently spotted tearing through the Japanese underground and other foreign grounds with insane combat technique.
; The Sages designated it "RECORD:MT" and quickly filed it away.
; In Gensokyo it was just online buzz, but now it's drawing attention with repeated sightings in the World of Fantasy.
; Once battle begins, it stalks its prey from behind, then savagely pounces through any opening like a beast of steel. 
